  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\n**((0.06)² + (0.66)² + (0.666)²)/((0.006)² + (0.066)² + (0.0666)²)**\n\n⇒ **((0.06)² + (0.66)² + (0.666)²)/((frac{0.06){10})² + ((0.66)/(10))² + ((0.666)/(10))²}**\n\n⇒ ((0.06)² + (0.66)² + (0.666)²)/(frac{1){100}[(0.06)² + (0.66)² + (0.666)²]}\n\n⇒ 100\n\n**∴ Option 4 is the correct answer.**",
